          "en": "They set out seeking the caravan[^bukhari:3951], and Allah willed for them a day He named [﴿the Day of the Criterion, the day the two armies met﴾](q:8:41). On it He separated truth from falsehood; Allah may bring good from where a servant does not expect it."
